&lt;li&gt;Expand to new demand sources by enabling MCP buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the strategy for fast iteration and evolution of our agentic offerings in a fast-moving space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a growing team and delegate across business verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross functionally with numerous partners including product, engineering, sales, marketing, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
