&lt;li&gt;Technical depth - Experience with LLM and agentic harness architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tack record of successful partnerships with infrastructure, ML, and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly or cross functionally with monetizations teams at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directly managing individual contributors of varying levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, a related field, or equivalent experience; advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
