&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting this application, I certify that all information submitted in my application and throughout the hiring process is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that any false statement, omission, or misrepresentation may disqualify me from employment consideration or result in termination if discovered after hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pinterest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the PM Director for Advertiser Growth, you will own product strategy for a major monetization lever and serve as a critical thought partner to our Business Platforms leadership. You will sit at the intersection of AI and monetization growth, defining the &quot;AI era&quot; for our core advertiser tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a unique combination of platform depth and tangible business impact. You won’t just be managing features; you will establish durable platform strategies that scale. Furthermore, this is a dedicated people leadership role where you will have the mandate to develop the next generation of product talent at Pinterest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Led Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the adoption, retention, and revenue impact of our suite of business-facing tools through intelligent product investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish a durable platform strategy for the Pinterest Business Assistant, encompassing various sub-agents while leading the advertising and merchant sub-agent efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive business outcomes by aligning priorities across Engineering, Data Science, TPM, Product Marketing, Sales, UX, and UXR teams to deliver best-in-class business tooling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Product Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience developing and scaling platforms, with a strong ability to distinguish between high-level orchestration and specific feature development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Tools Product Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven background in designing and managing sophisticated business-facing tools, account management consoles, or complex user journeys in an advertising or related environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of building, managing, and growing high-performing teams, including experience in talent development and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI/Agentic Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building AI-assistance functionality, specifically in a chatbot or agentic capability context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to navigate ambiguity, influence across multiple stakeholders, and drive durable revenue growth through principled trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
