&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pinterest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pinterest is looking for an Engineering Manager II, to lead the Personalization team within the Performance Ad Formats organization. In this role, you will guide a multidisciplinary team building personalized, high-performing ad experiences that help Pinners move from intent to action while improving click quality, conversion outcomes, and advertiser value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a multidisciplinary engineering team spanning iOS, Android, Web, and Backend, creating a strong culture of ownership, technical excellence, and inclusive collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution for a portfolio of lower-funnel ad format investments, including personalized product and shopping experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Design, Data Science, PMM, and peer engineering teams to shape strategy, prioritize roadmap investments, and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong engineering practices across technical design, planning, experimentation, launch quality, and production health to help the team move quickly and reliably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, experimentation, and sound judgment to improve key outcomes such as good click volume, click quality, and conversion performance while maintaining a high-quality Pinner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate technical and organizational complexity across multiple partner teams, clarifying tradeoffs and aligning stakeholders around goals, sequencing, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate analysis, iteration, and prototyping across product and engineering workflows, while applying strong judgment and verification to ensure quality, safety, and correctness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and automation to streamline repeatable team workflows such as documentation, reporting, and quality checks so the team can focus more time on high-impact problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of industry experience in software engineering, with 4+ years of people management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of managing teams of at least 8+ engineers across multiple technical domains, including client and backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and managing high-performing software engineering teams across multiple technical domains, including client and backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product orientation with a track record of translating business goals and user needs into execution plans that drive measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex cross-functional initiatives across Product, Design, Data Science, PMM, and partner engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ads, monetization, personalization, recommendation systems, experimentation platforms, or other data-driven product environments at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve speed and quality in day-to-day workflows such as analysis, prototyping, synthesis, planning, or operational execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of critically evaluating and verifying AI-assisted work through testing, source-checking, data validation, experimentation, and peer review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and ownership: you protect sensitive data, avoid over-reliance on AI, and remain accountable for final decisions, people leadership, and delivered outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
