&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end order lifecycle, delivering accurate and timely orders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high‑performing team with clear goals, regular coaching/reviews, and a culture of accountability and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run case and queue management to consistently meet or exceed SLAs and customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the point of escalation for complex orders, exceptions, and policy approvals; drive root‑cause fixes to prevent recurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-driven accountability and strategic insights by developing, monitoring, and analyzing key operational metrics to identify performance trends, optimize processes, and enable informed decision-making across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales Strategy, Revenue Operations, and Sales to improve order experience and policy clarity, while driving prioritized process and automation enhancements that boost efficiency, quality, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain SOPs, playbooks, and training; ensure compliance with accounting policy, revenue recognition readiness, and internal controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize reporting to measure team and inform decisions, evaluate and share key insights regularly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
