&lt;li&gt;Build sophisticated models that will deliver cutting-edge insights and improve revenue forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-driven financial tools and platforms (for example, to automate data analyses, identify revenue trends, or enhance forecasting accuracy) as appropriate; proactively seek opportunities to apply AI and automation to process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of financial reporting to Pinterest executives (e.g. Senior Director of Sales Finance, CFO, as well as Sales leaders including the CBO and their direct reports).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create dashboards and models to scale monitoring of key performance indicators and tools to drive strategic insight.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other strategic programs within Pinterest like agencies, resellers, and partnerships with advertisers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your superior financial modeling skills in order to deliver ad hoc analyses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in SQL, financial analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional spreadsheet skills (Google Sheets and/or Excel) with experience creating financial models and dashboards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication as well as presentation skills (Google Slides).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task and deliver against tight timelines.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with using AI-powered analytics or forecasting tools (such as ChatGPT, Tableau with AI features, or Google Cloud AI platforms) to streamline financial analysis, generate insights, or create reports. Ability to learn and adapt to evolving AI-driven tools and methodologies in financial planning is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field, such as Accounting, Finance, Economics, or Business or minimum of 3 years of experience in Sales Finance, Corporate Finance, FP&amp;amp;A, Investment Banking, or other quantitative fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
