&lt;p&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times/quarter and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from one of the following offices: &lt;strong&gt;San Francisco, Los Angeles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
