&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject-matter expert on the Pinterest API and partner integrations, the deep expert on Pinterest&#39;s business products and how to best troubleshoot them for partners&lt;/li&gt;
