&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We let the type of work you do guide the collaboration style. That means we&#39;re not always working in an office, but we continue to gather for key moments of collaboration and connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times per week and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from the following office:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Dublin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
