&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration once a week and therefore needs to be situated in &lt;strong&gt;Dublin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
