&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and drive a multi-year technical strategy for delivery retrieval infrastructure, partnering with engineering leaders to align investment and execution with organizational OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the architecture and delivery of large-scale distributed systems across retrieval, targeting and indexing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale retrieval systems toward 10x capacity while improving latency, freshness, reliability and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging infrastructure approaches and translate relevant innovations into practical, high-impact technical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with machine learning, product, infrastructure and other engineering teams to turn ambiguous technical and business needs into clear, actionable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership, architectural guidance and mentorship that strengthens execution across a 20–30 engineer organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate analysis and iteration on system designs and technical proposals, while applying judgment and verification to ensure correctness and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to synthesize technical information and streamline repeatable documentation or analysis tasks, while maintaining ownership of final decisions and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of relevant industry experience in delivery retrieval, search infrastructure or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling high-throughput, low-latency distributed retrieval or online serving infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern retrieval paradigms, including embedding-based retrieval, approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) techniques and indexing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting and optimizing complex performance, latency and capacity challenges in high-volume production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technical strategy, driving cross-functional alignment and guiding complex projects from definition through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and upleveling engineers through technical guidance and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in backend systems programming with C++, Java or Python, with strong C++ experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve speed and quality in relevant workflows, critically evaluate and verify AI-assisted work and protect sensitive data while remaining accountable for final decisions and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s/Master’s degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
