&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring junior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills, especially in a cross-functional set up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI to improve speed and quality in applied research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of publications and patents&lt;/li&gt;
