&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading architecture and delivery for complex software systems spanning product surfaces, backend services, data signals and external integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing agent enabled systems and MCP based integrations, with strong judgment around reliability, security, data quality and user trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Product to shape roadmaps, prototype new ideas and make technical tradeoffs that support growth goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in experimentation, measurement and causal thinking, with the ability to connect product and technical decisions to business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving the effectiveness of an AI first engineering team through technical direction, design reviews, coaching and practical improvements to AI assisted development, testing and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve speed and quality in your day to day workflow for relevant outputs, while critically evaluating and verifying AI assisted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
