&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration&lt;strong&gt; 1-2 times every quarter &lt;/strong&gt;and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from the following office: &lt;strong&gt;San Francisco or &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Palo Alto Office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
