&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience designing, building, and operating production data systems or data-intensive services at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills in Python and SQL, with a record of writing tested, maintainable production code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with ingestion, large-scale ETL and transformation, data modeling, and workflow orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data interfaces and contracts and improving quality, freshness, completeness, and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
