&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;is not&lt;/strong&gt; eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our PinFlex page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Requirement Statement: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times/month and therefore can be situated anywhere in the country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
